{"sections":[{"slug":"非Abel上同调","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"非Abel上同调"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"非 Abel 上同调"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调是一种广义的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">强调其系数对象并非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">系数的</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调类一一对应于</span> $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的等价类</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调的一种计算方法是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/非交换Čech上同调","text":"Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">长正合列</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于群短正合列</span> $K\\to G\\to H$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维列</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nK\\to G\\to H\\to \\mathbf{B}K \\to \\mathbf{B}G \\to \\mathbf{B}H,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">从而有非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调的正合列</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\nH^0(X,K) &amp;\\to H^0(X,G) \\to H^0(X,H)\\\\\r\n\\to H^1(X,K) &amp;\\to H^1(X,G) \\to H^1(X,H).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断群的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/中心扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">中心扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nA \\to G \\to H\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">即不仅要短正合列</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">还要求</span> $A\\to G$ <span lang=\"zh\">落在</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/中心","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">中心</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">纤维列与长正合列还能增加一项</span>:\n$$\r\nA\\to G \\to H \\to \\mathbf{B}A \\to \\mathbf{B}G\\to\\mathbf{B}H\r\n\\to\\mathbf{B}^2 A,\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    H^0(X,A) &amp;\\to H^0(X,G) \\to H^0(X,H)\\\\\r\n\\to H^1(X,A) &amp;\\to H^1(X,G) \\to H^1(X,H)\\\\\r\n\\to H^2(X,A) &amp;.\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">群结构</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">虽然名为</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">非交换</span>” Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">当然它也可以处理交换群</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/E2-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_2$"}},{"Plain":"-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $\\mathbf{B}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">从而</span> $H^1(X,A)=\\pi_0\\operatorname{Hom}(X,\\mathbf{B}A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为群</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">具体地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $P_1,P_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">分别由</span> $p_1,p_2\\colon X\\to\\mathbf{B}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">分类</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑如下拉回图</span>.\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccccc}\r\n    P_1\\times_X P_2 &amp; \\to &amp; * \\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    ? &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathbf{B} A &amp; \\to &amp; *\\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    X &amp; \\underset{(p_1,p_2)}{\\to} &amp; \\mathbf{B}A\\times\\mathbf{B}A &amp; \\underset{\\mu}{\\to} &amp; \\mathbf{B}A\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\mu$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathbf{B}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的乘法映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">竖直向下的映射</span> $\\mathbf{B}A\\to\\mathbf{B}A\\times\\mathbf{B}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathbf{B}(a\\mapsto (a^{-1},a))$.\n<span lang=\"zh\">图中问号位置的对象即是</span> $P_1$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $P_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $H^1(X,A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">和</span></strong>\n$$\r\nP_1+P_2 := (P_1 \\times_X P_2) / A,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">通过</span> $(p_1,p_2) a = (p_1 a^{-1}, p_2 a)$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/群作用","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">作用</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">于</span> $P_1\\times_X P_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3>Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">平展景与平坦景</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Zariski景","text":"Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/平展景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展景</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/平坦景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平坦景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上计算同一个群概形</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n$ (<span lang=\"zh\">对应的层</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的上同调</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">比较映射</span>\n$$\r\nH^1(X_{\\mathrm{Zar}},\\mathrm{GL}_n)\\to\r\nH^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathrm{GL}_n)\\to\r\nH^1(X_{\\mathrm{flat}},\\mathrm{GL}_n)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">均为同构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于域</span> $k$, $H^1(\\operatorname{Spec}k,\\mathbb G_m)=0$. <span lang=\"zh\">这是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hilbert定理90","text":"Hilbert <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span> 90"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><em><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></em>. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Zar-fl-et","text":"Zariski, <span lang=\"zh\">平展与平坦的比较</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}